/* Reinstall a reusable logical wait suffix without executing its frames.
   Thread.cont is the mutable physical scheduler root; cont remains an ordinary
   multi-shot continuation root. Preserve the current denv: service parameter
   updates are not rolled back by an internal repark. No allocation or frame
   payload copy occurs between these root publications and the queue callback. */
